```python
class Solution:
    def maxRatings(self, units: List[List[int]]) -> int:
        all_units = []
        for row in units:
            all_units.extend(row)
        all_units.sort()
        m = len(units)
        # Sum of the largest m units
        return sum(all_units[-m:])
```
